    <main class="page-shell">
        <section class="home-hero" id="home-hero">
            <div class="home-hero__danmaku home-hero__danmaku--back" id="home-danmaku-back" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="home-hero__danmaku home-hero__danmaku--front" id="home-danmaku-front" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="home-hero__frame">
                <p class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="hero.eyebrow">Bilibili Meme Index</p>
                <h1 class="home-hero__title">万恶之源</h1>
                <p class="home-hero__subtitle" data-i18n="hero.subtitle">B站梗文化索引, 社区共建, 修仙等级体系</p>
                <div class="home-hero__cta">
                    <a href="memes.html" class="btn btn--solid" data-i18n="hero.btnBrowse">来逛逛</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/Zw-awa/the-origin-of-the-meme/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="hero.btnContribute">我要投稿</a>
                    <a href="hall-of-fame.html" class="btn btn--muted" data-i18n="hero.btnHall">荣誉殿堂</a>
                </div>
                <div class="home-hero__meta">
                    <span data-i18n="hero.meta1">COMMUNITY-DRIVEN</span>
                    <span data-i18n="hero.meta2">NO ADS</span>
                    <span data-i18n="hero.meta3">OPEN REPO</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section page-section--tight">
            <div class="panel">
                <div class="panel__inner">
                    <div class="section-head">
                        <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="stats.title">数据总览</span>
                        <p class="section-head__copy" data-i18n="stats.subtitle">每一个数字背后, 都是一段B站传说</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stats-grid">
                        <article class="stat-card">
                            <span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-total-memes">0</span>
                            <span class="stat-card__label" data-i18n="stats.memes">收录梗数</span>
                        </article>
                        <article class="stat-card">
                            <span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-total-contributors">0</span>
                            <span class="stat-card__label" data-i18n="stats.contributors">贡献者</span>
                        </article>
                        <article class="stat-card">
                            <span class="stat-card__value" id="stat-total-videos">0</span>
                            <span class="stat-card__label" data-i18n="stats.videos">收录视频</span>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section home-tiers">
            <div class="section-head">
                <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="tierSystem.eyebrow">修仙天梯</span>
                <h2 class="section-head__title" data-i18n="tierSystem.homeTitle">把梗当作修仙，楼梯就是它的登顶路径。</h2>
                <p class="section-head__copy" data-i18n="tierSystem.homeCopy">这不是一个“内容很多才成立”的板块。哪怕现在只收录了 1 个梗，等级体系、上升路径和空层级的未来感也应该先被做出来。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="stair-stage panel">
                <div class="stair-stage__header" data-i18n="tierSystem.stageHeader">Tier Ascent</div>
                <div class="stair-stage__body" id="js-stair-stage-body">
                    <div class="stair-scene">
                        <div class="stair-celestial" aria-label="关于等级体系">
                            <div class="stair-celestial__stripes" id="js-stair-stripes" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                            <div class="stair-celestial__text">
                                <span class="stair-celestial__title" data-i18n="tierSystem.panelTitle">关于 · ABOUT</span>
                                <p data-i18n="tierSystem.panel1">B 站梗文化索引库</p>
                                <p data-i18n="tierSystem.panel2">按收录数量自动判定等级</p>
                                <p data-i18n="tierSystem.panel3">当前数据很少，但体系先成立</p>
                                <p data-i18n="tierSystem.panel4">以后内容会顺着楼梯往上长</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="stair-cloud-band" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 200" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                                <path d="M 0 200 L 0 150 C 8 142, 18 138, 28 142 C 38 110, 58 95, 80 105 C 95 70, 130 50, 160 80 C 175 60, 200 65, 215 95 C 230 78, 250 82, 260 110 C 285 60, 330 35, 365 70 C 380 90, 400 88, 415 105 C 440 50, 480 30, 510 75 C 525 100, 545 95, 555 115 C 575 70, 615 75, 640 100 C 660 65, 695 60, 720 95 C 740 80, 765 84, 775 110 C 795 60, 840 50, 870 90 C 890 110, 910 105, 925 120 C 945 95, 975 100, 990 130 C 996 138, 1000 142, 1000 145 L 1000 200 Z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>

                        <div class="stair-stairs" id="js-stair-canvas"></div>

                        <div class="tier-plate" id="js-tier-plate">
                            <span class="tier-plate__num"></span>
                            <span class="tier-plate__name"></span>
                            <span class="tier-plate__range"></span>
                            <div class="tier-plate__body"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section home-rankings">
            <div class="section-head">
                <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="rankings.title">梗排行榜</span>
                <h2 class="section-head__title" data-i18n="home_rankings.title">先把“榜单的腔调”做出来，再等更多梗上榜。</h2>
                <p class="section-head__copy" data-i18n="home_rankings.copy">当前条目不够多时，不补伪数据。只保留真实榜单，再用占位行告诉访问者这个体系会继续长。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="panel">
                <div class="panel__inner">
                    <div class="home-ranking-list" id="home-ranking-list"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section home-contributors">
            <div class="section-head">
                <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="contributors_section.title">贡献者殿堂</span>
                <h2 class="section-head__title" data-i18n="contributors_section.homeTitle">现在人少没关系，先把“被记录”的感觉做对。</h2>
                <p class="section-head__copy" data-i18n="contributors_section.homeCopy">首轮施工要保证哪怕只有一位贡献者，这一段也足够像一面共建者墙，而不是空白占位。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="home-contributors__grid" id="home-contributors-grid"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section home-hall">
            <a href="hall-of-fame.html" class="home-hall-card panel">
                <div class="panel__inner">
                    <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="nav.hall">荣誉殿堂</span>
                    <h2 class="home-hall-card__title" data-i18n="home_rankings.hallTitle">当某个梗真正封神，它不该只在榜单里被看见。</h2>
                    <p class="home-hall-card__copy" data-i18n="home_rankings.hallCopy">Hall of Fame 继续承担“世界观最重”的展示任务。首页只负责把人引过去，把气质托住。</p>
                    <span class="home-hall-card__cta link-arrow" data-i18n="home_rankings.hallCta">Enter the Hall</span>
                </div>
            </a>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section home-about">
            <div class="panel">
                <div class="panel__inner home-about__grid">
                    <article>
                        <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="home_about.what">是什么</span>
                        <h2 class="home-about__title" data-i18n="home_about.whatTitle">这是一个给 B 站梗留档的索引站。</h2>
                        <p data-i18n="home_about.whatCopy">它不是内容农场，也不是流量入口。它只是把梗名、出处、视频和贡献者记录下来，让后来的人还能追到源头。</p>
                    </article>
                    <article>
                        <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="home_about.how">怎么做</span>
                        <h2 class="home-about__title" data-i18n="home_about.howTitle">数据跟着社区长，页面先把框架撑起来。</h2>
                        <p data-i18n="home_about.howCopy">当前数据很小，所以首轮施工重点放在壳层、结构、主题切换和空状态。内容会慢慢积累，但网页不能等内容够多了才开始精致。</p>
                    </article>
                    <article>
                        <span class="section-head__eyebrow" data-i18n="home_about.why">为什么</span>
                        <h2 class="home-about__title" data-i18n="home_about.whyTitle">因为“梗”本来就值得被认真保存。</h2>
                        <p data-i18n="home_about.whyCopy">今天看似零碎的经典句子、鬼畜桥段和评论弹幕，几年后都会变成一代人的互联网记忆。</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

